  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint evaluation of the IRF&#x2019;s TTDI (end-review) and EPAIU (mid-term) programmes</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Joint evaluation of the IRF&#x2019;s TTDI (end-review) and EPAIU (mid-term) programmes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med uppdraget &#xe4;r att utv&#xe4;rdera tv&#xe5; bidrag fr&#xe5;n samma samarbetspartner &#x2013; International Renaissance Foundation (IRF): i) Think Tank Development Initiative (TTDI) (Planit ID 11195)/end-review och ii) Evironmental Policy and Advocacy Initiative ( EPAIU) (Planit ID 12686)/halvtidsgranskning. Dessutom syftar det till att informera International Rennaisance Foundation och Sveriges ambassad om behovet av m&#xf6;jliga justeringar f&#xf6;r EPAIU under de kommande 1,5-2 &#xe5;ren samt &#xf6;verv&#xe4;gande av projektets exitstrategi eller n&#xe4;sta st&#xf6;domg&#xe5;ng. Dessutom ska utv&#xe4;rderingen g&#xf6;ra en inventering av l&#xe4;rdomar, viktiga hinder, viktiga resultat och prestationer av TTDI f&#xf6;r att fatta ett v&#xe4;lgrundat beslut om n&#xe4;sta steg som h&#xe4;nf&#xf6;r sig till st&#xf6;d till tankesmedjor i Ukraina. Villkor bifogas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the assignment is to evaluate two contributions of the same cooperation parter &#x2013; International Renaissance Foundation (IRF): i) Think Tank Development Initiative (TTDI) (Planit ID 11195)/end-review and  ii) Evironmental Policy and Advocacy Initiative (EPAIU) (Planit ID 12686)/mid-term review. Besides, it aimst o inform the International Rennaisance Foundation and the Embassy of Sweden on the need for possible adjustments for EPAIU for the next 1,5-2 years as well as consideration for the project exit strategy or next round of support. Additionally, the evaluation shall take stock of lessons learned,key impediments, major findings and accomplishments of the TTDI to take an informed decision on next steps pertaining to support of think tanks in Ukraine. Terms of Reference enclosed.</narrative>
  </description>
